# RISK//SWARM has no backend and ships as a static site — BYOK LLM keys (OpenAI/OpenRouter/Gemini)
# are entered in-app (/models) and stay in browser localStorage; they are never env vars and never
# committed. See core/reasoner/llm.ts and app/store/models.ts.
#
# JEV_API_KEY is different: it is read only by Node/Bun-side code (system1/jev/client.ts), for the
# evaluation harness and tests — never bundled into the browser app. Unset today because Jev access
# is invite-only and no invite exists yet (see system1/jev/registry.ts). Leave unset; the client
# fails closed to UNAVAILABLE rather than fabricating a result.
JEV_API_KEY=
